    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "there is no \"next hour\". there's no next month or next year. i've already decided. i've spent the last few hours just thinking about how much easier it would be if i just didn't have to deal with the shame of this. i can't face my parents or my peers knowing i'm a failure. it feels like the only way to actually stop this feeling is to just... stop everything. it's just easier to let it all go.",
